 CellLabel->
  "Out[23]= ",ExpressionUUID->"612fd791-c81e-86f2-10d4-cedae9a8ecd8"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
A register of one block is the identity on everything \[LongDash] same \
generators, same label matrix, same circuits \[LongDash] which is what keeps \
the rest of the layer unaffected by this object existing.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"26dca2d1-2715-746d-4ee3-3b9b52a05eb7"],

Cell["\<\
The gate between blocks is the transversal CNOT: qubit by qubit, so each \
qubit of one block touches exactly the corresponding qubit of the other and \
nothing else. That is the property that stops a single fault from spreading \
inside either block.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"296a77cd-8fa3-dd44-5f6a-6e972a57a7ae"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"reg", "[", 
  RowBox[{"\"\<TransversalCNOT\>\"", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2"}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[24]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"6b853673-18d0-d9fa-19ba-a83d996aabc0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "1", ",", "8"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "2", ",", "9"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "3", ",", "10"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "4", ",", "11"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "5", ",", "12"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "6", ",", "13"}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"CNOT\"\>", ",", "7", ",", "14"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "Out[24]= ",ExpressionUUID->"25b5b884-ef74-61b3-534a-31e18a013399"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Steane EC was already resting on this being the logical CNOT. Here it is \
computed, by conjugating the logical operators through the gate and reading \
the images off:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"574a2197-51ef-7938-7d49-b8d1679a4802"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"reg", "[", 
  RowBox[{"\"\<LogicalAction\>\"", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2"}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[25]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"6e85e9ed-427b-8528-16ba-00b7770fec72"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"X\"\>", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], 
    "\[Rule]", "\<\"IIXIXXIIIXIXXI\"\>"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"X\"\>", ",", "2", ",", "1"}], "}"}], 
    "\[Rule]", "\<\"IIIIIIIIIXIXXI\"\>"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"Z\"\>", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], 
    "\[Rule]", "\<\"IZIZIZIIIIIIII\"\>"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"Z\"\>", ",", "2", ",", "1"}], "}"}], 
    "\[Rule]", "\<\"IZIZIZIIZIZIZI\"\>"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "Out[25]= ",ExpressionUUID->"73b76025-96bb-3fff-214d-798f234f85c5"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Read as logical operators: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "1"], "\[Rule]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "1"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "31f4c073-8ff6-126f-678b-da3d298360b5"],
 " (the image spans both blocks), ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "2"], "\[Rule]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "72ff7667-e560-b2c0-2285-68408c1a002a"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "1"], "\[Rule]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "1"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c9be80e-0554-61c1-24b8-0268ace1332b"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "2"], "\[Rule]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "1"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "106b7ad8-6378-599b-4069-7382160d2be1"],
 ". That is the action of a CNOT on the logical pair."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e6f7c7a-fa8f-2da1-2615-7627ff3a778b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On the five-qubit code the same gate does something else, and ",
 StyleBox["how", "TI"],
 " it fails is worth keeping in mind: the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["Z", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "304452a4-201b-d64c-607c-4b0e51afbc96"],
 " half of the action still comes out right and only the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["X", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6beff1f8-c64a-83a6-1994-e8a5f3fcd18c"],
 " half breaks, so a check that looked only at the logical operators would \
have passed half the time. What decides is whether the gate maps the \
stabilizer group to itself \[LongDash] the next section's question."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4b5b9263-9199-4e16-7978-144d202c157c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "5. ",
 Cell[BoxData["QECTransversalGate"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "475d7054-346c-a3cc-6d63-6a1ebd1ef116"],
 " \[LongDash] the gates a code performs for free"
}], "Section",ExpressionUUID->"2ef71510-aa09-eca9-568c-8d5dcfbdb6f3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A gate applied to every qubit of a block separately cannot spread one fault \
into two, so transversal gates are the cheapest fault-tolerant gates there \
are. Which ones a code admits is a question about the ",
 StyleBox["symmetry", "TI"],
 " of its stabilizer: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["U", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"\[CircleTimes]", 
     StyleBox["n", "TI"]}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3343f580-98d5-e31c-6170-ecea1961ce66"],
 " is a valid gadget exactly when it maps the stabilizer group to itself, and \
the logical gate you get is whatever it does to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "20a7420b-376a-b23f-505d-6455421c0105"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6af863a9-1098-c609-1a98-7af3a112ad53"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"055bc2ad-6b92-a3be-3378-dbf70e24f184"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"QECTransversalGate", "[", 
   RowBox[{"steane", ",", " ", "\"\<H\>\""}], "]"}], 
  "[", "\"\<LogicalAction\>\"", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[26]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"2b0fb60e-2211-365f-5934-286857a59ca5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"X\"\>", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", "\<\"Z\"\>"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"Z\"\>", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", "\<\"X\"\>"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "Out[26]= ",ExpressionUUID->"201a2509-bdd9-2fa1-5039-bd53346c758b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Transversal Hadamard, logical Hadamard (eq. 11.18\[Dash]11.19). Now the \
same question for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["S", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7085d256-6adc-aa08-20ba-d4100f6ef952"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5f932952-49a5-d34f-05a0-c11c6851a195"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"g", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"QECTransversalGate", "[", 
      RowBox[{"steane", ",", " ", "\"\<S\>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
   "    ", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<transversal\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<TransversalQ\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<action\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<LogicalAction\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<logical gate\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<LogicalGate\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "|>"}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[27]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"160f17c4-d31a-fe19-3e34-8ea1e6acc563"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"transversal\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"action\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\<\"X\"\>", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", "\<\"-Y\"\>"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\<\"Z\"\>", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", "\<\"Z\"\>"}]}], 
     "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"logical gate\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"Sdg\"\>"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "Out[27]= ",ExpressionUUID->"10beb8bd-bdb6-ee93-4045-31e73440b4f9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A minus sign, and it is a different gate.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], "\[Rule]", "-", 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], "_"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3fdc991b-fead-14b0-65e3-1144fb587e9a"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3657d2c5-05c0-ac85-5e6c-cbafac7af6ef"],
 " fixed is the action of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["S", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0642d375-09f3-9942-2e71-cb3faf87eba8"],
 ": the transversal ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["S", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0651775d-2bad-791b-2e6f-6f074e584861"],
 " performs the ",
 StyleBox["inverse", "TI"],
 " of the gate it is made of. The sign is one line of Pauli algebra:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"63b9e3d6-2298-231e-1146-fa9057128e64"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"QECPauliString", "[", 
  RowBox[{"QECPauliProduct", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<XXXXXXX\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<ZZZZZZZ\>\""}], "]"}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[28]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"67c13665-f813-2f11-0dfe-a84ef9a6727b"],

Cell[BoxData["\<\"iYYYYYYY\"\>"], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "Out[28]= ",ExpressionUUID->"4c440104-ea8a-4285-747b-99618f3f10ef"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], " ", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"\[CircleTimes]", "7"}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66c9a615-af45-c085-0ef6-385ecaf192ef"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], "_"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["X", "TI"], "_"], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "_"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0513e607-0f4c-1e20-3320-f861aaf9650a"],
 ", so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"\[CircleTimes]", "7"}]], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["Y", "TI"], "_"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0371ff35-cd30-cda2-310e-f77ee4ca9788"],
 " (eq. 11.22). Everywhere else in this layer a conjugation modulo sign is \
enough; here the sign ",
 StyleBox["is", "TI"],
 " the answer, so this object carries the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["Z",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "4"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6833ae6a-6ac5-a2c8-19c0-40340f71f012"],
 " phase through every step and asks membership of a routine that knows a \
generator's true phase."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5f7f2999-1aee-25a5-0504-c0c39e988f8f"],

Cell["\<\
Being a gate gadget at all is the other half, and it is reported generator by \
generator rather than as one boolean, because the interesting failures are \
partial:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"128c7526-c883-085d-42b4-6c83e9365aa7"],

