    "ibid., Theorem 12.5", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "330aabc0-bdd5-22a3-6109-42aa34607089"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "38c8cb12-19a5-fbf9-68f7-e35c9851c9c3"], Cell[
